                        Executor Framework — Quick Revision

                        Executor (Interface)
                                ↓ extends
                        ExecutorService (Interface)
                                ↓ implements
                        AbstractExecutorService (Abstract Class)
                                ↓ extends
                        ThreadPoolExecutor (Class)
                        Executor → execute()
                        ExecutorService → submit(), shutdown(), shutdownNow(), awaitTermination()
                        AbstractExecutorService → common implementation of submit(), invokeAll(), invokeAny()
                        ThreadPoolExecutor → actual worker threads + task queue + thread management
                        Executors → utility class; creates executors using newFixedThreadPool(), newCachedThreadPool(), etc.
                        Runnable → run() → no result
                        Callable → call() → returns result
                        Future → represents the result; get(), cancel(), isDone()

